Refresh icons (CYLRefresh)
--------------------------

Animations made for the icon of a refresh control: pulling, refreshing, loading more, done. Set them on the
animated-image controls (CYLRefreshAnimationHeader, CYLRefreshBackAnimationFooter, CYLRefreshAutoAnimationFooter)
with `-setBundledIconAnimation:size:forState:`; `+bundledIconAnimationFileNames` lists them together with the two
placeholder animations above that also mean refresh (CYLPlaceholderRefresh.json, CYLPlaceholderProgress.pag).
Only files whose content means a refresh state are kept here.

* The lottie-android files below come from its snapshot-tests/.../lottiefiles/ folder, contributed from
  lottiefiles.com, with the same status as the lottie-ios LottieFiles samples above.

